<body>
  <main class="app">
    <header>
      <h1>
        <span>FAQ</span>
        <span>Flashcard</span>
        <span>Reviewer</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="lede">Paste FAQ questions and answers, review them as cards, flag stale claims or missing proof, then copy a short update list.</p>
    </header>

    <section class="panel" aria-labelledby="pasteTitle">
      <h2 class="panel-title" id="pasteTitle">Paste FAQ set</h2>
      <textarea id="faqInput" spellcheck="true">Q: How often should this FAQ be reviewed?
A: Review any answer with prices, dates, product details, legal rules, policy language, or statistics at least quarterly.

Q: What counts as missing evidence?
A: A claim is missing evidence when it makes a factual promise but does not point to a source, date, internal note, report, policy page, or proof snippet.

Q: What makes a claim stale?
A: Claims using phrases like currently, latest, this year, recently, or now should be checked because they can age quickly.</textarea>
      <p class="hint">Accepted formats: Q:/A: blocks, question and answer separated by a blank line, tab-separated rows, or question | answer rows.</p>
      <div class="btn-grid">
        <button class="primary" id="parseBtn">Build flashcards</button>
        <button class="soft" id="sampleBtn">Load sample</button>
        <button id="saveBtn">Save locally</button>
        <button class="danger" id="clearBtn">Clear saved data</button>
      </div>
      <p class="small-status" id="saveStatus" aria-live="polite"></p>
    </section>

    <section class="panel" aria-labelledby="scoreTitle">
      <h2 class="panel-title" id="scoreTitle">Freshness score</h2>
      <div class="status-row">
        <div class="meter-wrap">
          <div class="meter-label">
            <span>Review health</span>
            <span id="scoreLabel">0/100</span>
          </div>
          <div class="meter" aria-hidden="true">
            <div class="meter-fill" id="meterFill"></div>
          </div>
          <div class="score-big" id="scoreBig">0</div>
        </div>
        <div class="meter-wrap">
          <div class="meter-label">
            <span>Deck status</span>
            <span id="deckCount">0 cards</span>
          </div>
          <p class="hint" id="scoreExplain">Build cards to score freshness. Flags and time-sensitive language lower the score.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="panel" aria-labelledby="reviewTitle">
      <h2 class="panel-title" id="reviewTitle">Review cards</h2>

      <div id="emptyState" class="empty">No cards built yet.</div>

      <div id="reviewArea" hidden>
        <div class="card-stage">
          <article class="review-card" aria-live="polite">
            <div>
              <div class="card-kicker" id="cardSide">Question</div>
              <div class="card-text" id="cardText"></div>
            </div>
            <div class="progress" id="progressText"></div>
          </article>
        </div>

        <div class="btn-grid">
          <button id="prevBtn">Previous</button>
          <button class="primary" id="flipBtn">Flip card</button>
          <button id="nextBtn">Next</button>
          <button class="soft" id="shuffleBtn">Shuffle</button>
        </div>

        <div class="flag-grid" aria-label="Card flags">
